docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R64.md:12:This task is the contract gate for the redesigned MCP tool surface. It asserts every shipped tool round-trips request/response through serde without loss, exposes the spec-required render modes (`compact`, `full`, `diagnostic`, `handles`), keeps every deprecation shim from the T02 compatibility policy responding correctly, and surfaces no schema drift between the implementation, the T61 reference doc, and any client expectations. Without this gate, schema drift between the daemon and assistant clients goes undetected until production, violating spec §Non-Negotiable Product Properties "Every public MCP contract is documented and regression-tested."
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R64.md:16:> "Every public MCP contract is documented and regression-tested." (spec §Non-Negotiable Product Properties)
