docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T83.md:46:   - **No broad workspace read**: a query whose anchors don't resolve must not silently fall back to reading the entire workspace. Assert the daemon returns a "no anchors resolved" error or empty result with a documented marker, never a 10k-file scan dump per `## Non-Negotiable Product Properties`.
