docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T85.md:12:This task delivers the complete documentation suite Phase 11 mandates. Spec §Documentation Requirements lists eleven required documents: successor architecture overview, MCP contract reference (which T61 was responsible for; this task collects/links it), memory model reference, event log design, consolidation design, retrieval/ranking design, verification/freshness design, operator guide, migration guide from Lattice, benchmark/evaluation guide, extension review UI guide. Spec §Phase 11 DoD includes "documentation for setup, operations, memory semantics, and workflow behavior"; this task closes the documentation surface area so the system is "production-grade for repeated agent use, not only successful on a toy repo."
