docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R47.md:12:This task is the Phase 6 backend review. It audits T39–T46 against the spec's consolidation contract, the §Non-Negotiable Product Properties bullets that consolidation directly touches (replayability, observability, no silent broad mutation), and the coding standard. The review must produce a verdict on whether Phase 6 is ready to ship and gate Phase 7 (T48 verification engine begins under R47). It records concrete evidence — file paths, function names, test names, log lines — for every claim. A pass/fail decision without cited evidence is not a review.
