docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/R70.md:12:This task delivers the Phase 9 review. It asserts that the metrics collection module (T65), the cross-language benchmark fixture repository (T66), the MCP-wired metrics surface (T67), the regression dashboard + CLI report (T68), and the regression coverage tests (T69) together satisfy spec §Phase 9 deliverables and definition of done, and that each spec §Measurable Success Criteria initial target is either met by T69's tests or recorded as a `fail` finding triggering reopen. Without this review, Phase 10 (Human Review UI) proceeds against an unvalidated metrics layer and the success-criterion claims cannot be defended.
