docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R79-contract-extension-daemon.md:141:Composite methods are exercised at the bridge level by `extension/src/test/review.test.ts` (the wrapper-shaped contract test for the webview), against a `StubBridge` returning wire-shaped fixtures matching the same `rpcPayloads.ts` types. That wiring confirms the panel state machine reads the same typed payloads the daemon emits — there is no shape inversion between bridge → panel.
