docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T46.md:31:  - Test fixtures from Phase 2 + Phase 3 (seeded workspaces, events, memories).
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T46.md:32:- Standards: Cadres coding standard §Tests as documentation (one test per behavior, named for the behavior), §Hard limits (test length ≤30 lines, factor setup into fixtures); Lattice rules on doc-heading citation.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/baselines/cognitive_workspace_metrics.json:3:    "fixture": "python-repo",
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/baselines/cognitive_workspace_metrics.json:210:    "fixture": "rust-repo",
