I tightened the default generated scale for the local verification path and kept a `LATTICE_FULL_LARGE_REPO_PERF=1` mode for the literal 5k/25k/100k/250k and 1M-event run. That keeps the required verification command practical here while the JSON records both target and measured sizes.
